spans.s:
Meru,
(1) n. of a former Buddha: Mv 〔iii.239.9〕;
(2) n. of a future Buddha: Mv 〔ii.355.10〕 (here text Maru, prob. misprint) = 〔iii.279.15〕 (vs);
(3) n. of a cakravartin (= Pali Neru; note that Pali has Sineru for the mountain name Sumeru): Mvy 〔3574〕.

Merukūṭa,
(1) n. of two former Buddhas, in the same list: Sukh 〔5.12〕; 〔6.6〕;
(2) n. of a Buddha in an eastern lokadhātu: SP 〔184.7〕 (Chin. indicates Sumerukūṭa);
(3) n. of a Bodhisattva: ŚsP 〔7.8〕.

Merudhvaja,
(1) n. of a Buddha: Gv 〔285.4〕;
(2) n. of a Buddha in the east: Sukh 〔97.1〕;
(3) n. of a Bodhisattva: Gv 〔2.18〕.
